    "title": "Properstar",
    "description": "<p>No matter where you are, Properstar is the simplest way to find the perfect home.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With a selection of over 3 million homes in numerous countries, all listed by certified real estate agents, finding your next home is at your fingertips.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why choose Properstar?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Worldwide access:</strong> Dive into a selection of over 3 million homes, all listed by certified real estate agents.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>AI-powered searches:</strong> Leverage the latest in AI technology for a search experience that's not just efficient, but 100% relevant to your needs.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Tailor your perfect search:</strong> Quickly narrow down your search with popular filters, finding homes that meet your criteria with ease.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Personalized search areas:</strong> Use our intuitive map tool to draw your search area.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Immersive virtual tours:</strong> Step inside your potential new home from anywhere with detailed virtual tours that bring properties to life.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Stay ahead of the market:</strong> Get daily updates on your saved searches and immediate alerts on price drops, ensuring you never miss out.</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Easily schedule a visit:</strong> Schedule visits and connect with agents directly through the app, making it easier to get the answers you need.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Download Properstar now, set up your search, save it, and let us take care of the rest.</p>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<p>No matter where you are, Properstar is the simplest way to find the perfect home.</p><br><br><p>With a selection of over 3 million homes in numerous countries, all listed by certified real estate agents, finding your next home is at your fingertips.</p><br><br><p><strong>Why choose Properstar?</strong></p><br><br><ul><br>  <li><strong>Worldwide access:</strong> Dive into a selection of over 3 million homes, all listed by certified real estate agents.</li><br>  <li><strong>AI-powered searches:</strong> Leverage the latest in AI technology for a search experience that&#39;s not just efficient, but 100% relevant to your needs.</li><br>  <li><strong>Tailor your perfect search:</strong> Quickly narrow down your search with popular filters, finding homes that meet your criteria with ease.</li><br>  <li><strong>Personalized search areas:</strong> Use our intuitive map tool to draw your search area.</li><br>  <li><strong>Immersive virtual tours:</strong> Step inside your potential new home from anywhere with detailed virtual tours that bring properties to life.</li><br>  <li><strong>Stay ahead of the market:</strong> Get daily updates on your saved searches and immediate alerts on price drops, ensuring you never miss out.</li><br>  <li><strong>Easily schedule a visit:</strong> Schedule visits and connect with agents directly through the app, making it easier to get the answers you need.</li><br></ul><br><br><p>Download Properstar now, set up your search, save it, and let us take care of the rest.</p>",
